# PRINTED QR CODE TARGET — DO NOT DELETE OR RENAME THESE PATHS.
# Printed ads (golf course booklet, course signage) carry a QR code encoding
# HTTPS://RSITILE.COM/QR. Printed codes cannot be reissued, so these paths must
# keep working for as long as that material is in circulation. To send QR
# traffic somewhere else later, change only the destination below — never the
# path. 302 (not 301) on purpose: browsers cache a 301 hard, which would pin
# people to an old destination after the target changes.
# The UTM tags live here rather than in the QR itself, so the encoded URL stays
# short (fewer modules = scans from farther away) and the tags stay editable.
# The printed code uses CAPS (uppercase packs into a smaller, coarser QR), and
# path matching is case-sensitive, so both cases are listed.
/qr    /?utm_source=print&utm_medium=qr&utm_campaign=golf-course    302
/QR    /?utm_source=print&utm_medium=qr&utm_campaign=golf-course    302

